ento genético por sí mismas - BM Editores", "unwound_url": "https://bmeditores.mx/ganaderia/las-biotecnologias-de-reproduccion-asistida-no-son-mejoramiento-genetico-por-si-mismas/", "url": "https://t.co/UBvYnGbUii"}]}, "id": "2115564397040976256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "La tecnología es el acelerador. La selección es el motor\nIA, TE y FIV propagan genes, no los modifican\nSi el animal tiene genética promedio, la descendencia también\nLa excepción: edición genómica (CRISPR)\nEl mejoramiento genético no se compra: se decide\nhttps://t.co/UBvYnGbUii", "url": "https://x.com/BMEditores/status/2115564397040976256"}, {"author_id": "2033985762455420928", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:02:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115549742864183627"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 262, "start": 255, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 275, "start": 263, "tag": "geneediting"}], "urls": [{"description": "Near-NGS-level CRISPR editing analysis. Upload your Sanger files and receive results in seconds. across most samples, particularly when the samples contained a high percentage of indels. for Sanger sequencing-based indel frequency analysis, especially when the expected indels exceed the detection size limits of TIDE (-50/+50) and ICE (-30/+14). \" DECODR provides a convenient, cost-effective, and user-friendly method to quantify the edits present in CRISPR-edited Sanger sequencing data. Using a computationa", "display_url": "decodrinc.com", "end": 254, "expanded_url": "https://www.decodrinc.com/", "start": 231, "status": 200, "title": "Home | DECODR", "unwound_url": "https://www.decodrinc.com/", "url": "https://t.co/NYYwLpsJSU"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/WjEnmnXZK9", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/DECODRInc/status/2115549742864183627/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115548872651001856", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/WjEnmnXZK9"}]}, "id": "2115549742864183627", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Four Sanger-based editing tools. One independent comparison. Aoki et al. (Cells, 2024): “Among the four tools [TIDE, ICE, DECODR and SeqScreener], DECODR provided the most accurate estimations of indel frequencies.” Learn more at: https://t.co/NYYwLpsJSU\n#CRISPR #geneediting https://t.co/WjEnmnXZK9", "url": "https://x.com/DECODRInc/status/2115549742864183627"}, {"author_id": "1954418915603533824", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:13:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115567685279134055"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "　朝、鏡を見て「なんだか急激に老けたかも…😭」とショックを受けることはありませんか？ 　サプリも運動も頑張っているのに、以前のようなハリや元気が戻らない…。その悩み、実はあなたの努力不足ではなく、身体の", "display_url": "plaza.rakuten.co.jp/hiroshe/diary/…", "end": 99, "expanded_url": "https://plaza.rakuten.co.jp/hiroshe/diary/202610290000/", "images": [{"height": 240, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115567692166184962/e8kBw3Ja?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 240}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115567692166184962/e8kBw3Ja?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 76, "status": 200, "title": "100歳でも現役！？遺伝子の「書き換え」で手に入れる究極のアクティブエイジング✨ - ひろ｜40代からの「動ける・魅せる」アクティブエイジング：楽天ブログ", "unwound_url": "https://plaza.rakuten.co.jp/hiroshe/diary/202610290000/", "url": "https://t.co/Eg3grwMXtu"}]}, "id": "2115567685279134055", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "最新のバイオテクノロジー、特にノーベル賞でも話題の「CRISPR-Cas9（クリスパー・キャスナイン）」が、アンチエイジングの常識を根底から覆します！\nhttps://t.co/Eg3grwMXtu", "url": "https://x.com/hiro_anti_aging/status/2115567685279134055"}, {"author_id": "1580408538119417856", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:05:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115550519171375340"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature Biotechnology - smCRISPRa is a compact platform for high-efficiency multiplexed gene activation in mouse models.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/s4158…", "end": 148, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41587-026-03352-5", "images": [{"height": 2186, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115415414939561984/ssVQniIz?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1711}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115415414939561984/ssVQniIz?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 125, "status": 200, "title": "An engineered, compact Cas12m variant for multiplexed gene activation in vivo", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41587-026-03352-5?error=cookies_not_supported&code=430a084c-4d9a-49b1-9f73-60de8d44f33e", "url": "https://t.co/iLKfTtY6sr"}]}, "id": "2115550519171375340", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 632, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小型Cas12mを改変したsmCRISPRaを開発し、マウス体内で複数遺伝子を同時かつ高効率に活性化できることを示して、体内での多重遺伝子活性化に適した小型CRISPRプラットフォームを提示した論文がNat Biotechnol誌に発表されました。\nhttps://t.co/iLKfTtY6sr", "url": "https://x.com/iPatho1/status/2115550519171375340"}, {"author_id": "1349113598694588416", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:37:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115558497366798649"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/beldame_/statu…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/beldame_/status/2115554488388059507", "start": 232, "url": "https://t.co/aOtlBe0uh6"}]}, "id": "2115558497366798649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 4383, "like_count": 235, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115554488388059507", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Say tomorrow a CRISPR treatment becomes available that allows me to change the chromosomal marker in my cells, or make my testes produces eggs. \nEverything else remaining unchanged.\nTell me: do you think I would care? Would anyone? https://t.co/aOtlBe0uh6", "url": "https://x.com/boreddeleuzian/status/2115558497366798649"}, {"author_id": "1393846341223157763", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:47:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115561072908194265"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 124, "start": 119, "tag": "NTLA"}, {"end": 132, "start": 127, "tag": "PRME"}]}, "id": "2115561072908194265", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 1483, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "biotech:\n对于人体而言: \n\n人体的生产流程:DNA =&gt; RNA =&gt; 肽 =&gt; 蛋白质\n其中涉及到的投资对象大概如下:\n\nDNA:\n一般竞争, 发挥空间巨大, 各公司均选择了不同的技术以及靶点.\n=&gt; $NTLA , $PRME  in-VIVO crispr 体内基因编辑(非常革命性), 一次输液, 终身治愈.\n\nRNA:\n一般竞争, 发挥空间巨大,", "url": "https://x.com/harry03994688/status/2115561072908194265"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2081096572968771584", "name": "Sam", "username": "SamvelTruzyan"}, {"id": "2178209593", "name": "Stephanie Deiters", "username": "777anima"}, {"id": "543868205", "name": "BM Editores", "username": "BMEditores"}, {"id": "2033985762455420928", "name": "DECODR, Inc.", "username": "DECODRInc"}, {"id": "1954418915603533824", "name": "​ひろ｜40代からの「動ける・魅せる」アクティブエイジング", "username": "hiro_anti_aging"}, {"id": "1580408538119417856", "name": "谷口研究室（北海道大学医学部 統合病理学教室）", "username": "iPatho1"}, {"id": "1349113598694588416", "name": "Lacanian 🍷", "username": "boreddeleuzian"}, {"id": "1393846341223157763", "name": "中本麻三", "username": "harry03994688"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2115567685279134055", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlxo4ipynijbs1agmnq4yx408jul", "oldest_id": "2115549742864183627", "result_count": 8}}
